flowchart LR
    Start([Start: Calculate Tax]) --> FetchData[Fetch Reviewed Data & Selected AY]
    FetchData --> LoadConfig[Load Slabs & Rules from config.py]
    
    subgraph Old_Regime [Old Tax Regime Path]
        O_Std[Deduct Std Ded: Rs 50k] --> O_80C[Deduct 80C, 80D, 80TTA]
        O_80C --> O_Slab[Apply Slabs: 0%, 5%, 20%, 30%]
        O_Slab --> O_87A{Income <= Rs 5L?}
        O_87A -- Yes --> O_Reb[Section 87A: Up to Rs 12.5k]
        O_87A -- No --> O_Cess[Add 4% Cess]
        O_Reb --> O_Cess
    end

    subgraph New_Regime [New Tax Regime u/s 115BAC]
        N_Std[Deduct Std Ded: Rs 75k] --> N_Forfeit[Forfeit Deductions]
        N_Forfeit --> N_Slab[Apply Slabs: 0%, 5%, 10%, 15%, 20%, 30%]
        N_Slab --> N_87A{Income <= Rs 7L?}
        N_87A -- Yes --> N_Reb[Section 87A: Up to Rs 25k]
        N_87A -- No --> N_Cess[Add 4% Cess]
        N_Reb --> N_Cess
    end

    LoadConfig --> Old_Regime
    LoadConfig --> New_Regime

    O_Cess --> SpecialTax[VDA Gains u/s 115BBH @ 30%]
    N_Cess --> SpecialTax
    SpecialTax --> NetTax[Deduct TDS / Advance Tax]
    NetTax --> Rounding[Section 288A & 288B Rounding]
    Rounding --> Compare{Compare Liabilities}
    Compare --> Rec[Recommend Optimal Regime: NEW / OLD / EQUAL]
    Rec --> SaveComp[Persist Computation in DB & Display Results]
    SaveComp --> EndComp([Ready for Report Export])
